Readme for Padonak FPS
==========================================================

Windows Requirements:
  - OpenGL headers and libraries (Available with any modern version of Windows)

  Additional requirements for compiling:
  - Microsoft Visual Studio or equivalent



Linux Requirements:
  - OpenGL headers and libraries 
  - Xserver with GLX and XF86VidMode extensions 
  - libjpeg

  Additional requirements for compiling:
  - gcc or icc



Controls (This section will be inserted into the game later)
--------

ESC - Exit
W, Up Arrow - Move Forward
S, Down Arrow - Move Back
A - Move Left
D - Move Right
B1 - Shoot
B3 - Jump
M - Toggle Mirror
F1 - Full Screen
F3 - Pause
O - Fly
TAB - Change Camera view
T - switch to stencil mirror (if stencil-buffer 
      hardware support is not available, 
      this might slow down the execution)
PgUp - Look up
PgDn - Look down
Left Arrow - Look left
Right Arrow - Look right

